            "value": "同一目标 · 分别计算"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同轮题目共享任务并发上限；只要仍有待测题就尽量占满并发槽，同一模型的不同题也可并行。超时会终止当前请求；仅启用重试时重新发起，普通慢响应只记录耗时。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Each scan runs up to the selected number of tasks at once, including different questions for the same model. Timed-out requests stop and retry only when retries are enabled; other slow responses are recorded normally."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每轮扫描最多同时运行设定数量的任务，同一模型的不同题也可以并行。单次请求超时后会停止；只有启用重试时才会再次请求，其他慢响应仅记录耗时。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "图片展示其中 15 个，另有 %@ 个有效结果未展示。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The image shows 15; %@ other valid results are hidden."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "图片展示其中 15 个，另有 %@ 个有效结果未展示。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "增量补齐会由后端校验 24 小时内同题包、同评分协议且路线一致的结果；不满足条件时不会启动扫描。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "An incremental scan reuses only results from the last 24 hours with the same question set, scoring rules, and route. If none qualify, the scan will not start."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "增量扫描仅复用 24 小时内题包、评分规则和路线一致的结果；没有符合条件的结果时不会启动。"
          }
        }
      }
