    "请等待当前设置保存完成。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wait for the current settings to finish saving."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请等待当前设置保存完成。"}}}},
    "正在从 Codex 服务端获取可用模型…": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fetching available models from Codex…"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在从 Codex 服务端获取可用模型…"}}}},
    "已加入 %@，默认关闭。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Added %@; disabled by default."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已加入 %@，默认关闭。"}}}},
    "请先选择至少一个模型": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Select at least one model first"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请先选择至少一个模型"}}}},
    "正在验证连接…": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Testing connection…"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在验证连接…"}}}},
    "请求受到限流，正在保存连接草稿…": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The request was rate-limited. Saving the connection draft…"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请求受到限流，正在保存连接草稿…"}}}},
    "请求受到限流，连接草稿已保存；可稍后继续验证。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The request was rate-limited. The connection draft was saved; you can test it again later."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请求受到限流，连接草稿已保存；可稍后继续验证。"}}}},
    "请求受到限流，且连接草稿保存失败。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The request was rate-limited, and the connection draft could not be saved."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请求受到限流，且连接草稿保存失败。"}}}},
    "连接验证成功，正在保存…": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Connection test passed. Saving…"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"连接验证成功，正在保存…"}}}},
    "连接并保存成功": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Connection tested and saved"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"连接并保存成功"}}}},
    "连接验证成功，但保存失败。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"The connection test passed, but the connection could not be saved."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"连接验证成功，但保存失败。"}}}},
    "正在发现模型…": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Discovering models…"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"正在发现模型…"}}}},
    "请等待当前设置保存完成后再删除连接。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wait for the current settings to finish saving before deleting the connection."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请等待当前设置保存完成后再删除连接。"}}}},
    "存在运行中或可续扫任务，暂时不能删除连接。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This connection cannot be deleted while a scan is running or can be resumed."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"存在运行中或可续扫任务，暂时不能删除连接。"}}}},
    "请等待当前设置保存完成后再移除扫描档位。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wait for the current settings to finish saving before removing the scan profile."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"请等待当前设置保存完成后再移除扫描档位。"}}}},
    "存在运行中或可续扫任务，暂时不能移除扫描档位。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This scan profile cannot be removed while a scan is running or can be resumed."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"存在运行中或可续扫任务，暂时不能移除扫描档位。"}}}},
    "已添加，默认关闭；开启后可运行首次扫描。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Added and disabled by default. Enable it to run the first scan."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已添加，默认关闭；开启后可运行首次扫描。"}}}},
    "已选 %d 个配置 · %d 次评测": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%d configurations selected · %d evaluations"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已选 %d 个配置 · %d 次评测"}}}},
    "将移除 %d 个模型条目和 %d 个扫描档位。历史扫描成绩会保留，但不再参与推荐。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"This will remove %d model entries and %d scan profiles. Historical results will be kept but will no longer affect recommendations."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"将移除 %d 个模型条目和 %d 个扫描档位。历史扫描成绩会保留，但不再参与推荐。"}}}},
    "将移除 %@ 的 %d 个扫描档位。历史扫描成绩会保留，但不再参与推荐。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"For %@, this will remove %d scan profiles. Historical results will be kept but will no longer affect recommendations."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"将移除 %@ 的 %d 个扫描档位。历史扫描成绩会保留，但不再参与推荐。"}}}},
    "将移除 %@ 的 %@ 档位。历史扫描成绩会保留，但不再参与推荐。": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"For %@, this will remove the %@ profile. Historical results will be kept but will no longer affect recommendations."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"将移除 %@ 的 %@ 档位。历史扫描成绩会保留，但不再参与推荐。"}}}},
    "个人观察数据已清除，将从现在开始重新观察": {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Local usage data cleared. New tracking starts now."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"本机使用记录已清除，将从现在开始重新记录"}}}},
